    "_id": "the-nutty-oaxacan",
    "name": "The Nutty Oaxacan",
    "instructions": "1. Measure all ingredients except the Nocino and stir to combine.\n2. Transfer the mixture to a bottle.\n3. Store in the freezer before serving.\n4. Rinse a glass with the Nocino, then pour the chilled cocktail over a large cube.\n5. Garnish with an orange twist.",
    "created_at": null,
